
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Chiqish yozish: laugh, yangi-qator.

>> locked := Yolgʻon.
>> security := Rost.
security rost-boʻlsa: { locked := Rost. }.
Chiqish yozish: locked, yangi-qator.

>> n := 7.
(Rost) rost-boʻlsa: { n := 9. }.
Chiqish yozish: n.
